category: Math
build-depends: cygport libgtest-devel libhdf5-devel liblz4-devel
sdesc: "Fast Library for Approximate Nearest Neighbors (utilities)"
ldesc: "FLANN is a library for performing fast approximate nearest neighbor searches
in high dimensional spaces. It contains a collection of algorithms we found to
work best for nearest neighbor search and a system for automatically choosing
the best algorithm and optimum parameters depending on the dataset."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/flann-lib/flann/
license: BSD-3-Clause AND BSD-2-Clause
